{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA_n2000 as the encoder, achieving 48.5% validation accuracy and 46.4% F1 score. This establishes a baseline for RNA-only models, suggesting moderate performance but leaving uncertain whether multimodal approaches could improve results. The choice of PCA_n2000 encoder and absence of image data limit conclusions about optimal encoder design or modality integration."
}

